        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
        <p class="eyebrow">March 2026</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Launch version</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 text-sm leading-6 text-steel marker:text-accent">
          <li>Launched the first public version of Kreativ Auto with car pages, problem guides, and best-parts pages for common maintenance and repair decisions.</li>
          <li>Added browsing pages for brands, models, generations, and part categories so it is easier to jump from one vehicle or repair topic to the next.</li>
          <li>Expanded the homepage with featured cars, common problems, and parts guides to help visitors reach useful pages faster.</li>
          <li>Reworked the writing across the site to make problem symptoms, likely causes, and repair options clearer and easier to scan.</li>
          <li>Added real car and parts photos across key pages to make the site more visual and easier to browse.</li>
          <li>Published About, Affiliate Disclosure, Editorial Policy, and Contact pages so readers can better understand how recommendations are made.</li>
          <li>Improved search visibility with sitemap support, crawl guidance, breadcrumbs, and structured data.</li>
          <li>Brought the site live on its public domain.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
